                                                "sense_id": "3ae7be29-a3af-34f3-a1c9-645648205caa",
                                                "text": "“Revoking PNTR for Russia is going to make it harder for Russia to do business with the United States and doing it in unison with other nations that make up half of the global economy will be another crushing blow to the Russian economy that’s already suffering very badly from our sanctions,” Biden said."
